etb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carsonetb/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carsonetb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carsonetb/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carsonetb/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carsonetb/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carsonetb/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carsonetb/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-19T02:27:58Z","updated_at":"2025-02-20T01:02:59Z","body":"Looks like a lot of the checks are failing because you have the physics signal trying to connect in [touch_screen_button.cpp](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102963/files#diff-0f41ceaa3743ed1135c5221a3e370917f7642d7a439a47bc54c582c0864c9767), which is strange.\r\n\r\nAlso, if it's any help, here's some GDScript code from my suggestion that someone posted for toggling 3D collision shape visibility, not sure if it's applicable here:\r\n\r\n```GDScript\r\nparent.remove_child(node)\r\nparent.add_child(node)\r\n```\r\nEDIT: Removed a bunch of extra code from the snippet ... if anything it's at least interesting that this updates it.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2667361326/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2669751493","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102963#issuecomment-2669751493","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102963","id":2669751493,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6fISzF","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubuser